1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:04,979
Attention, staff. Gravity is
temporarily... optional.

2
00:00:05,019 --> 00:00:07,473
Rae! Everything's floating!

3
00:00:07,513 --> 00:00:09,469
Staff boots are magnetic.

4
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:11,528
Mine are on backwards!

5
00:00:12,498 --> 00:00:13,786
Pip?

6
00:00:14,556 --> 00:00:17,217
Hi! I'm mopping the ceiling!

7
00:00:17,257 --> 00:00:19,589
The ceiling is the floor now.

8
00:00:20,059 --> 00:00:23,608
Great news! Floating items
are now half price.

9
00:00:23,648 --> 00:00:25,475
We don't do sales.

10
00:00:25,515 --> 00:00:27,203
We do now.

11
00:00:27,243 --> 00:00:29,847
How do I get down?

12
00:00:29,887 --> 00:00:31,514
Wait.

13
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:35,340
Gravity restored in three... two...

14
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,711
One.
